# --- Canonical host enforcement -------------------------------------------
# These MUST come before the SPA catch-all below. Netlify processes rules top
# to bottom and the first match wins, so a leading /* rule swallows everything.
https://massmauto.netlify.app/*   https://massmauto.com/:splat   301!
http://massmauto.netlify.app/*    https://massmauto.com/:splat   301!
https://www.massmauto.com/*       https://massmauto.com/:splat   301!

# --- SPA fallback ----------------------------------------------------------
# Every other path is served index.html and handled by react-router.
/*    /index.html   200
